ans for disruption, volatility, bullwhip effects, data failures, and cross-functional accountability.", "children": [{"id": "20c45cad-5834-417d-97c2-2fcc0ac6c07f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Volatility and Disruption", "children": [{"id": "66585572-6c9b-4167-8d76-17597669ddd6", "type": "concept", "title": "Disruptions, pandemics, strikes, weather, geopolitics, inflation, channel shifts, and competitor moves"}, {"id": "64058bcf-5ca0-4eb0-a3d6-29db0e70f39f", "type": "concept", "title": "Structural breaks, regime changes, and forecast model decay"}, {"id": "1d56cf6c-d1fb-45cd-906e-b7d84b914cef", "type": "concept", "title": "Early warning indicators and recovery planning"}], "description": "Demand plans must survive shocks, sudden mix changes, and structural breaks."}, {"id": "39ab33d5-6d22-4263-b864-fcf1893ce6df", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scenario Planning", "children": [{"id": "aa7fc6d2-809a-4723-b2d8-36a9df36e143", "type": "concept", "title": "Base, upside, downside, stress case, sensitivity analysis, and what-if planning"}, {"id": "6f7854f1-2007-41e8-af46-8ddd36fc1f35", "type": "concept", "title": "Assumptions, triggers, probabilities, and contingency actions"}, {"id": "4621e70a-d830-40a8-8e07-5d08d37ca867", "type": "concept", "title": "Scenario communication for executives"}], "description": "Scenario planning turns uncertainty into explicit options."}, {"id": "0f36a089-9c8f-4e62-bde2-12c4a1b44b70", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Governance and Ethics", "children": [{"id": "1521b2d1-2fd0-420a-9aae-b7ab8998afb7", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecast ownership, override governance, audit trail, model governance, privacy, and bias"}, {"id": "f1eda5f2-6496-4032-9255-97bf283d5be5", "type": "concept", "title": "Gaming, target negotiation, and incentive misalignment"}, {"id": "a54ee6c1-4c1b-4ce0-ba85-031aef90aa2d", "type": "concept", "title": "Transparent assumptions and responsible automation"}], "description": "Forecasts are shaped by incentives, politics, and d